SymmetricPolynomials -- the algebra of symmetric polynomials
************************************************************

Description
===========

This package uses an explicit description of the Groebner basis of the ideal of
obvious relations in this algebra based on:

Grayson, Stillmann - Computations in the intersection theory of flag varieties,
preprint, 2009

Sturmfels - Algorithms in Invariant Theory, Springer Verlag, Vienna, 1993

Author
======

  * Alexandra Seceleanu (see https://aseceleanu.github.io/ )

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 1.0 of SymmetricPolynomials, released May
20 2009.

