buildSymmetricGB -- Groebner basis of elementary symmetric polynomials algebra
******************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        buildSymmetricGB R
  * Inputs:
      * R, a*note Ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,
  * Outputs:
      * the Groebner basis of the elementary symmetric algebra

